{
  "info": {
    "name": "EVA-WEB — API de Avatar",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el API de avatar del curso Evaluación y Control de Servicios Web.\n\n## Flujo recomendado\n1. Registrarse (register) → obtienes token\n2. Login (login) → script guarda token automáticamente\n3. Subir avatar (upload)\n4. Consultar avatar (show)\n5. Eliminar avatar (destroy)\n6. Cerrar sesión (logout)\n\nVariables:\n- {{base_url}}: http://eva-web.test\n- {{token}}: se llena automáticamente al hacer login",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://eva-web.test" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Registrarse",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
              "    console.log('Token guardado:', json.token);",
              "    pm.test('Usuario registrado y token obtenido', function() {",
              "        pm.expect(json.token).to.not.be.empty;",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Juan Perez\",\n    \"email\": \"juan@test.com\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"123456\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "register"]
        },
        "description": "Crea un nuevo usuario y devuelve un token de API.\n\nBody (JSON):\n- name: obligatorio\n- email: obligatorio, único\n- password: mínimo 6 caracteres\n- password_confirmation: debe coincidir con password"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Iniciar sesión",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
              "    console.log('Token guardado:', json.token);",
              "    pm.test('Login exitoso y token almacenado', function() {",
              "        pm.expect(json.token).to.not.be.empty;",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"juan@test.com\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "login"]
        },
        "description": "Autentica un usuario existente y devuelve un token.\n\nEl script de test guarda automáticamente el token en la variable {{token}}."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Subir avatar",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta 201 - Archivo subido', function() {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('url');",
              "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('checksum');",
              "    pm.expect(json.data.mime).to.match(/^(image\\/)/);",
              "    console.log('URL:', json.data.url);",
              "    console.log('SHA-256:', json.data.checksum);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "avatar",
              "type": "file",
              "src": "",
              "description": "Archivo de imagen (JPG, PNG o WEBP, máximo 2MB)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/avatar",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "avatar"]
        },
        "description": "Sube un avatar usando multipart/form-data.\n\nRequiere:\n- Header: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\n- Body: form-data → campo \"avatar\" de tipo File\n\nValidaciones del servidor:\n- Tipo MIME: image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp\n- Tamaño: máximo 2MB\n- Dimensiones: 100×100px mínimo, 1024×1024px máximo\n- Almacenamiento: nombre UUID único"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Obtener avatar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/avatar/1",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "avatar", "1"]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene la URL del avatar de un usuario por su ID.\n\nEndpoints públicos (no requiere token).\n- Si el usuario tiene avatar → 200 + URL\n- Si no tiene avatar → 404"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Eliminar avatar",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta 200 - Avatar eliminado', function() {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql('Avatar eliminado correctamente');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/avatar",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "avatar"]
        },
        "description": "Elimina el avatar del usuario autenticado.\n\nRequiere header Authorization: Bearer {{token}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Cerrar sesión",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta 200 - Sesión cerrada', function() {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "logout"]
        },
        "description": "Cierra la sesión eliminando el token actual."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Datos del usuario",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta 200 - Datos del usuario', function() {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('email');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('name');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "user"]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene los datos del usuario autenticado.\n\nRequiere header Authorization: Bearer {{token}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
